WEBVTT

00:03:59.318 --> 00:04:03.948
I created two new machine species
that I call "aerobes."

00:04:04.991 --> 00:04:08.828
I released 12 aerobes
into the museum space

00:04:08.869 --> 00:04:12.039
so they could form
their own small ecosystem.

00:04:13.291 --> 00:04:16.752
In order to minimize
our human-centric biases,

00:04:16.794 --> 00:04:21.007
and to steer clear
of simply mimicking the human form,

00:04:21.048 --> 00:04:25.303
I worked with my team
to look at the natural world,

00:04:25.303 --> 00:04:29.724
and we were inspired
by creatures like the comb jellyfish

00:04:29.724 --> 00:04:31.642
and the lion's mane mushroom.